  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ドドゲザンに　しんかできるのはだいぐんぜいの　ちょうてんに　たった１ぴきの　キリキザンだけなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "큰 군세의 정점에 올라선 단 한 마리의 절각참만이 대도각참으로 진화할 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在勢力浩大的軍團中，唯有站上頂點的那１隻劈斬司令，才能進化成仆斬將軍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seul un Scalproie qui s’est hissé au plus haut rang d’une grande armée peut évoluer en Scalpereur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Allein das Caesurio an der Spitze seiner riesigen Armee kann sich zu Gladimperio entwickeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solo el Bisharp más destacado entre las filas de cada gran ejército tiene el honor de evolucionar a Kingambit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solo il Bisharp che si erge alla vetta della propria armata può evolversi in Kingambit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Only a Bisharp that stands above all others in its vast army can evolve into Kingambit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ドドゲザンに　進化できるのは大軍勢の　頂点に　立った１匹の　キリキザンだけなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在气势磅礴的军团中，只有站上顶点的那只劈斩司令才能进化成仆刀将军。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solo el Bisharp más destacado entre las filas de cada gran ejército tiene el honor de evolucionar a Kingambit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "だいぐんぜいを　ひきいて　たたかうがむずかしい　さくせんは　にがてなのでちからで　おして　おしまくるだけ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "큰 군세를 이끌고 싸우나 어려운 작전을 세우는 데는 재주가 없어서 그저 힘으로 밀어붙이려고만 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會引領大軍戰鬥，卻不擅長有難度的戰術，只會靠蠻力來壓制對手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon commande une grande armée, mais c’est un piètre stratège. Il s’obstine donc à recourir à la force brute.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es führt eine große Armee in den Kampf. Da es jedoch kein guter Stratege ist, muss es sich letztendlich auf rohe Gewalt verlassen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuenta con un enorme ejército a sus órdenes. Sin embargo, debido a sus escasas dotes como estratega, termina recurriendo a la fuerza bruta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lotta al comando di un grande battaglione, ma non è bravo a escogitare strategie sofisticate, perciò si limita a usare la forza bruta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Though it commands a massive army in battle, it’s not skilled at devising complex strategies. It just uses brute strength to keep pushing.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大軍勢を　率いて　戦うが難しい　作戦は　苦手なので力で　押して　押しまくるだけ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会引领大军来战斗，却不擅长困难的战术，只会用蛮力来压制对手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
